Subject: [PATCH] fix(engine): nx patch set for system-manager

- numtide/system-manager#551 (etc activation failures)
- user/dropped-backups: restore backed-up entries dropped from the config
- user/446-ephemeral: keep --ephemeral activation under /run (#446),
  apply tmpfiles rules that replaced an existing file, skip the userborn
  restart when the unit is not found
- nx only: route more ephemeral runtime config dirs to /run
